# Store and check out text as LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# This repository is unusually sensitive to line endings. The build tool
# normalises the upstream sources to LF before patching, because the patch
# anchors are LF literals and gofmt counts every CRLF line as a difference --
# which would make the formatting-regression check tolerate anything. The
# generated Go file and the macOS launcher script are written LF on purpose
# too. Letting core.autocrlf rewrite any of that on checkout would be a slow,
# confusing failure on someone else's machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touched, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.7z  binary
*.zip binary
*.db  binary
